Privacy Policy

Simple: Gym Tracker does not collect, store, or share any personal data.

    No data is stored locally (except for the data needed for app functionality such as Workouts, Settings and Preferences) and absolutely no personal data is sent to any third-party servers.
    This app complies with privacy regulations, including GDPR and COPPA, as it does not collect any personal data.

If you have questions, please open an issue at: https://github.com/Lutmak/simple-gym-tracker/issues

